{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S05只有18秒，未标“到时出现”的感受仍然堆得很密，容易来不及扫读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮词把每段的心理支点直接凸显出来，水面、小船、摇荡到最后停稳的意象也形成了连续线索，前后更像一件完整的事。它的感受描述还能贴合具体乐句出现，音乐细节和心理变化都比X细腻。X的双栏更容易快速扫完，因果叙述也更顺，尤其Y的S13有一处逻辑衔接稍显跳跃；但综合来看，Y提供的重点、意象连贯性和感受层次更丰富。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "76e887de-b6f4-496b-b12d-d29430074492", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T164045218712Z", "elapsed_seconds": 193.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:43:58.685712+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c6893ffc35753ed404f89b5047490a847b6af6604f08312d123d977cbdb464a5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238850000257